# Secrets. `.env.example` is the committed template; `.env` never is.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The SQLite database. Transactions only — the catalogue itself lives in
# content/*.ts and is not here.
data/

# Licence deliveries. RTL source, gate-level netlists, SDF, Liberty, GDSII and
# the porting kits. These are the purchasable product: they are licensed to one
# buyer and must never be reachable by guessing a URL, so they sit outside
# public/ and are streamed only through an entitlement check.
#
# ⚠️ This line is easy to forget and was once missing in the reference project,
# where the first real sale would have committed a customer's paid IP to a
# public repository. Ignored here for the same reason.
server/files/

# Generated block diagrams and floorplan previews are SVG data URIs, so unlike
# the reference project there is no render directory and no image provider.